    tenSceneChuyenToi: 
  - laNhanVatChinh: 1
    npcID: 
    noiDung: "Ng\u1EADm m\xE1u phun ng\u01B0\u1EDDi! Cha ta c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EDDi
      thanh b\u1EA1ch, \u0111\u1EBFn h\u1EA1t g\u1EA1o c\u1EE7a d\xE2n c\u0169ng
      kh\xF4ng d\xE1m nh\u1EADn sai! L\xE0m sao c\xF3 chuy\u1EC7n tham \xF4? "
